<title>SWITZERLAND: Selecta buys Finland's Boomers Oy.</title>
<headline>Selecta buys Finland's Boomers Oy.</headline>
<dateline>WALLISELLEN, Switzerland 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swiss vending machine retailer Selecta, which went public in May, said it would acquire all the shares of Finnish company Boomers Oy on August 1 for an undisclosed amount.</p>
<p>Boomers Oy's annual sales of vending services are 5.5 million Swiss francs, Selecta said in a statement.</p>
<p>Together with Vendco Oy, which Selecta acquired last year, Selecta's sales in Finland exceed 10 million francs.</p>
<p>The purchase of Boomers Oy makes Selecta market leader in Finland.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
